    <h2>Description of Services</h2>

    <h3>Stoat for Android</h3>
    <p>Stoat for Android is an open-source native Android client for the Stoat/Revolt chat platform. It provides access to your Stoat account, servers, channels, and messaging features.</p>

    <h3>Stoatcord Bot</h3>
    <p>The Stoatcord Bot is a Discord application that provides:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Channel migration</strong>: Import Discord server channel structures into a Stoat server.</li>
        <li><strong>Message bridging</strong>: Relay messages in real time between linked Discord and Stoat channels.</li>
        <li><strong>Slash commands</strong>: Server management commands for linking, unlinking, and managing bridges.</li>
    </ul>

